        "id": "condition-3",
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "code": {
          "text": "Health anxiety contributing to increased distress and requests for over-investigation"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-1",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-1",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Low back pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Gradual onset 2 days ago; central, across the belt line; aching stiffness, VAS approximately 5–6/10. Worse with bending and standing from sitting; improves somewhat lying flat. Non-radiating, with no leg symptoms. No trauma, fall, or heavy lifting. Patient wondered whether increased toilet trips or straining contributed; posture, prolonged plane sitting, and an uncomfortable mattress were discussed as more likely triggers."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Low back pain neurological, spinal, and bowel/bladder red flags"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "By history: no saddle anaesthesia, leg weakness, paraesthesia, gait disturbance, urinary incontinence or retention, or change in bowel control. No weight loss, night sweats, cancer history, IV drug use, or significant trauma."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Loose stools after travel"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Returned from Bali 5 days ago; loose stools began approximately 24 hours after return. Currently 4–5 watery bowel movements per day. No blood or mucus reported."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-4",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Abdominal pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild crampy lower abdominal pain before a bowel movement, relieved after passing stool. No severe abdominal pain reported."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-5",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-5",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Fever and associated symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports no fever, vomiting, or rigors; home temperature described as \"36-something\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Hydration and urine output"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Drinking water and pharmacy oral rehydration solution; passing urine every 3–4 hours, light yellow. No postural dizziness or palpitations reported. By history, no features of severe dehydration."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Travel-related exposures and associated symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Ate street food and drank iced drinks in Bali. No recent antibiotics, known sick contacts at home or work, dysuria, or loin pain. No history of IBD reported."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Telehealth examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Limited phone examination: alert and coherent, speaking in full sentences, sounds comfortable with no shortness of breath. Reports no fever. By history, no systemic toxicity."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Health-related anxiety and concerns"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Repeatedly expressed anxiety about cancer and spinal infection, need for imaging, and travel-related parasites or a \"superbug\"; reported searching online for C. difficile. Requested full stool and blood testing."
      }
    },
    {
